# Google Maps Platform API Key
# Never commit a real API key or hardcode it in source files.
#
# Option 1 (Free Zero-Billing Prototyping — Maps Demo Key):
# 1. Open https://mapsplatform.google.com/maps-demo-key?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# 2. Sign in with any Google account (no billing card required).
# 3. Accept the Maps Demo Project Terms when prompted.
# 4. Click to generate / reveal your Maps Demo Key.
# 5. Copy the key below into a local `.env` file (`cp .env.example .env`).
# Note: The Maps Demo Key has a daily reset limit and is NOT for production use.
#
# Option 2 (Production Key):
# Create a restricted key in Google Cloud Console:
# https://console.cloud.google.com/google/maps-apis/credentials?utm_campaign=gmp_git_agentsamples_v1.0.0
# Enable: Maps JavaScript API, Places API (New), Routes API, Geocoding API.
# Restrict by HTTP referrer and designated APIs.
GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=your_google_maps_api_key_here
